WEBVTT

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:07.200
He's coming home.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:08.190
Haimura-kun.

00:00:08.570 --> 00:00:10.820
Yay!

00:00:13.090 --> 00:00:15.030
Yay!

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:17.020
They say they're going to 
spend a night over there.

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:19.600
He wants to take the Transportal tomorrow.

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:23.210
Really?

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:24.710
Yeah.

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:29.820
Damn Haimura, flirting with 
the Russian beauty!

00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:33.280
A soldier needs his rest.

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:35.660
I wish I could have gone with them.

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:40.660
Maya.

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:46.980
I... I wanted to see Moroha-san 
as soon as I could.

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.510
Be patient, until tomorrow, okay?

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:55.990
Okay.

00:02:33.330 --> 00:02:34.880
I've had it!

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:37.170
I'm going to kill you now!

00:02:37.970 --> 00:02:40.770
How could you just go off 
with the forbidden curse?!

00:02:40.770 --> 00:02:44.180
Russia's map changed because of you!

00:02:44.490 --> 00:02:48.010
We might as well call it the Sea of Haimura.

00:02:48.010 --> 00:02:49.940
Anything but that.

00:02:50.350 --> 00:02:54.440
Angela, please forgive him now.

00:02:54.870 --> 00:02:55.960
Yeah.

00:02:55.960 --> 00:02:58.940
Don't go lecturing in a sauna, 
it's getting so stuffy.

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:01.290
Why are we even in a mixed bath?

00:03:01.290 --> 00:03:04.300
It's Finland-style, of course we're mixed!

00:03:04.300 --> 00:03:06.160
How could you not know that?

00:03:06.780 --> 00:03:07.700
Right.

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:10.090
There, there, there, you two.

00:03:10.090 --> 00:03:12.530
You shared a bed naked.

00:03:12.530 --> 00:03:14.140
That's enough.

00:03:16.440 --> 00:03:17.960
Nii-sama!

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:23.340
Angela-san, would you please explain?

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:26.470
W-We had some complicated circumstances.

00:03:26.780 --> 00:03:27.970
Complicated.

00:03:29.030 --> 00:03:30.050
I'm depressed.

00:03:30.050 --> 00:03:31.490
I'm so depressed.

00:03:31.490 --> 00:03:34.550
Why did my beloved brother 
sleep with an English woman?

00:03:34.550 --> 00:03:35.840
Brother?!

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:38.980
You're still saying stuff like that?

00:03:39.530 --> 00:03:40.850
My brother is my brother.

00:03:45.710 --> 00:03:47.920
Who's your brother?!

00:03:47.100 --> 00:03:50.410
They've been at it since we were in Japan.

00:03:47.920 --> 00:03:50.410
He's my brother, so he's my brother.

00:03:48.460 --> 00:03:49.860
What the heck are you talking about?!

00:03:50.880 --> 00:03:55.520
Then I challenge you for the 
position of younger sister!

00:03:55.950 --> 00:03:56.820
I accept that challenge.

00:04:03.160 --> 00:04:04.400
Hot!

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:10.340
The first one to give up loses.

00:04:10.340 --> 00:04:11.260
Agreed.

00:04:27.320 --> 00:04:29.030
It's too hot.

00:04:29.030 --> 00:04:31.730
Oh, my God.

00:04:33.190 --> 00:04:34.710
I can't take it!

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:36.400
I'm leaving!

00:04:36.780 --> 00:04:38.170
Me, too.

00:04:38.770 --> 00:04:41.630
Oh no, I'm getting dizzy from the heat.

00:04:43.050 --> 00:04:43.630
Huh?

00:04:45.680 --> 00:04:49.060
Get it? Strength is love, love is strength.

00:04:49.060 --> 00:04:51.660
I have just as much love for Moroha.

00:04:51.660 --> 00:04:53.140
Then...

00:04:55.140 --> 00:04:58.150
Can you do this in this heat?

00:04:58.740 --> 00:05:00.150
Easily.

00:05:02.630 --> 00:05:04.330
Not bad.

00:05:05.090 --> 00:05:07.590
So what's the point of this?

00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:10.660
You stay out of this, Moroha!

00:05:11.260 --> 00:05:12.160
Okay.

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:14.790
Let's arm wrestle, then.

00:05:14.790 --> 00:05:16.170
All right.

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:18.350
Ready, go!

00:05:16.680 --> 00:05:18.350
Why arm wrestling?

00:05:18.350 --> 00:05:22.170
We'll just have to watch over 
them with mild kindness.

00:05:22.730 --> 00:05:27.190
I'm not handing Nii-sama to you!

00:05:27.190 --> 00:05:29.680
I'm not giving up, either!

00:05:32.520 --> 00:05:35.460
Khorosho!

00:05:39.290 --> 00:05:41.530
Dosukoi!

00:05:44.810 --> 00:05:45.830
I'm hot.

00:05:45.830 --> 00:05:47.030
I think I'll die.

00:05:47.430 --> 00:05:50.760
It's set, I'm the true younger sister!

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:58.140
Hey, guys!

00:05:58.140 --> 00:05:59.480
Leave this to me.

00:05:59.480 --> 00:06:00.270
Write.

00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:05.670
White Breath!

00:06:16.610 --> 00:06:18.500
My heart is freezing.

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:21.310
Here you are, warm Russian tea.

00:06:21.310 --> 00:06:23.020
Thank you.

00:06:23.450 --> 00:06:25.530
These two are idiots.

00:06:28.870 --> 00:06:30.850
Hot!

00:06:30.850 --> 00:06:36.130
Hey, where's Urushibara? She did this to us!

00:06:37.440 --> 00:06:38.790
Gross!

00:06:42.980 --> 00:06:44.500
Are you all right?

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:47.310
You aren't sick from the 
sauna heat, too, are you?

00:06:47.310 --> 00:06:50.580
No, it's just been a while 
since it's been so lively.

00:06:50.580 --> 00:06:52.680
I've been traveling with only 
one other person for a while.

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:53.760
I see.

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:55.780
And that's why you held each other naked.

00:06:55.780 --> 00:06:57.730
Like I said, that's...

00:06:58.460 --> 00:07:00.390
I knew from the beginning.

00:07:00.390 --> 00:07:02.440
We kept in contact the whole time, after all.

00:07:02.880 --> 00:07:04.220
Seriously...

00:07:04.660 --> 00:07:08.230
You better not leave us behind anymore.

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:10.860
We're going to be together forever.

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:12.450
Past life, and present life.

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:19.960
Speaking of past lives, I had a 
strange dream during the trip.

00:07:20.440 --> 00:07:21.210
What about?

00:07:22.160 --> 00:07:26.590
I don't remember too clearly, 
but there was an unfamiliar monster.

00:07:27.240 --> 00:07:30.520
It took away the things I 
cared about one after another.

00:07:31.330 --> 00:07:32.930
It was an ominous dream.

00:07:34.240 --> 00:07:37.560
That dream might not have been a memory

00:07:37.560 --> 00:07:40.980
from the past, but a dream about the future.

00:07:42.430 --> 00:07:43.740
No way.

00:07:47.530 --> 00:07:48.630
No way.

00:07:55.490 --> 00:08:01.480
<b>White Knight Agency Japan Branch</b>

00:07:56.900 --> 00:07:58.780
I see, understood.

00:07:58.780 --> 00:08:01.000
Please tell Haimura-kun I said hi.

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:04.750
Was that from Mari?

00:08:05.090 --> 00:08:08.490
Yeah, the Russia group is coming home.

00:08:11.060 --> 00:08:13.420
I wish I could have seen it myself, too.

00:08:13.420 --> 00:08:15.760
Forbidden curses against forbidden curses.

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:18.760
I bet it would have been as 
awesome as the Battle of Kursk.

00:08:19.020 --> 00:08:20.470
Stop with the nonsense.

00:08:20.470 --> 00:08:22.440
It's thanks to that—

00:08:24.640 --> 00:08:25.230
Ando!

00:08:27.040 --> 00:08:29.480
It's a sign that a Metaphysical 
is approaching.

00:08:43.310 --> 00:08:45.480
So this is a Transportal.

00:08:50.190 --> 00:08:52.960
Haimura-han, I wish we could 
spend more time, but be well.

00:08:53.360 --> 00:08:55.770
Say hi to Katya-san and Yuli-san.

00:08:56.590 --> 00:08:59.100
Nii-sama, come on, come on.

00:08:59.400 --> 00:09:00.700
Yeah, coming.

00:09:02.720 --> 00:09:04.350
<b>Voice communication
Ando Suruga</b>

00:09:10.930 --> 00:09:12.360
I'm home.

00:09:12.660 --> 00:09:14.650
Welcome home.

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:15.860
I'm glad you're safe.

00:09:16.890 --> 00:09:19.370
Japan's still stuffy.

00:09:22.940 --> 00:09:24.870
That was a short return home.

00:09:25.840 --> 00:09:26.830
Huh?

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:30.720
Moroha-san.

00:09:30.720 --> 00:09:32.260
I've never used it before.

00:09:32.850 --> 00:09:35.100
It's a strange sensation.

00:09:37.350 --> 00:09:38.800
Satsuki-oneesan?

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:41.490
What's Moroha-san doing?

00:09:42.300 --> 00:09:43.810
Nii-sama is...

00:09:57.150 --> 00:09:59.020
Sorry, Haimura-han.

00:09:59.020 --> 00:10:01.480
It was me who defeated the Russian Rank-S.

00:10:01.480 --> 00:10:03.660
I can't just leave them.

00:10:04.060 --> 00:10:06.560
The Lightning Emperor is sorry, too.

00:10:06.560 --> 00:10:08.150
She'll be back eventually, I'm sure.

00:10:08.150 --> 00:10:09.210
It's coming.

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:11.620
Katya-san, cover me from behind.

00:10:11.620 --> 00:10:12.630
Got it.

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:15.420
Yuli-san and I will stop it.

00:10:15.420 --> 00:10:16.450
Roger.

00:10:25.480 --> 00:10:27.390
Moroha-san.

00:10:27.850 --> 00:10:30.900
Moroha-san!

00:10:46.100 --> 00:10:51.960
Nii-sama told us to come home 
because everyone must be worried.

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:56.460
And he told me to say hi to you, Maya.

00:10:56.880 --> 00:11:02.140
I've been sleeping alone in my room, 
ever since Moroha-san went to Russia.

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:04.170
I was so lonely.

00:11:04.170 --> 00:11:07.020
My pillow was drenched in tears every night.

00:11:08.190 --> 00:11:12.680
All right, let's sleep in 
my room together, then.

00:11:13.890 --> 00:11:17.180
I might not replace Nii-sama, but...

00:11:22.040 --> 00:11:23.660
What's going on?

00:11:24.220 --> 00:11:25.890
I don't know, either.

00:11:25.890 --> 00:11:29.470
Jack was successful in defeating the 
Metaphysical that turned up in Russia.

00:11:29.470 --> 00:11:30.780
There's no mistake about that.

00:11:31.320 --> 00:11:35.380
Yet Ando's pain is only getting worse.

00:11:35.380 --> 00:11:38.010
He finally lost consciousness.

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:41.480
Just wait over there, please.

00:11:41.480 --> 00:11:42.570
<i>Why?</i>

00:11:42.570 --> 00:11:45.070
<i>I want to be with you as 
soon as possible, sir.</i>

00:11:45.630 --> 00:11:47.370
I just have a really bad

00:11:48.680 --> 00:11:50.530
feeling about this.

00:12:01.670 --> 00:12:03.230
Cheer up.

00:12:03.230 --> 00:12:05.070
Nii-sama will be back tomorrow.

00:12:08.690 --> 00:12:10.040
Momo-senpai.

00:12:10.850 --> 00:12:13.550
I thought Maya might be lonely.

00:12:13.550 --> 00:12:15.610
Is it okay if I sleep with you?

00:12:16.570 --> 00:12:19.160
Of course, you're always welcome.

00:12:23.110 --> 00:12:26.090
A very middle-class room.

00:12:26.090 --> 00:12:28.350
But it might be good social education for me

00:12:28.350 --> 00:12:30.560
to sleep in a place like this for a change.

00:12:30.800 --> 00:12:33.760
Well sorry I'm middle class.

00:12:36.390 --> 00:12:38.070
Good evening.

00:12:38.470 --> 00:12:40.070
You, too, Sophie-senpai?

00:12:41.300 --> 00:12:42.320
Sorry.

00:12:43.430 --> 00:12:44.320
I'm depressed.

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:46.920
Huh?

00:12:47.730 --> 00:12:51.870
When you're lonely, 
I'll talk to you about adult things!

00:12:57.360 --> 00:12:59.840
There're so many people here.

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:03.090
No problem, let's pajama party!

00:13:03.420 --> 00:13:05.590
That's not the point!

00:13:06.010 --> 00:13:09.580
Ranjou-san, are you not even 
going to serve your guests tea?

00:13:09.580 --> 00:13:14.970
I heard potato chips are a given at 
gatherings like this in Japan, so I brought some.

00:13:15.300 --> 00:13:17.540
I brought cola, too.

00:13:18.400 --> 00:13:21.110
That's so American, such barbaric taste.

00:13:26.490 --> 00:13:28.780
Dammit, do whatever you want!

00:13:29.190 --> 00:13:30.280
Did you hear that?

00:13:31.420 --> 00:13:32.580
I did.

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:34.540
No mistake about it.

00:13:34.900 --> 00:13:36.790
Wh-What?

00:13:37.720 --> 00:13:43.300
I've been told that pillow fights are 
a custom at sleepovers in Japan.

00:13:43.530 --> 00:13:44.590
Huh?

00:13:45.480 --> 00:13:48.550
Oh? My apologies, Ranjou-san.

00:13:48.950 --> 00:13:51.540
Urushibara!

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:02.020
London Bridge!

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:04.990
Here I go, Maya!

00:14:07.740 --> 00:14:09.660
How could you?

00:14:10.580 --> 00:14:12.370
Pillow attack!

00:14:12.740 --> 00:14:14.080
Payback!

00:14:16.180 --> 00:14:18.300
I'm pissed now!

00:14:20.760 --> 00:14:22.750
Y-You little...

00:14:23.100 --> 00:14:27.360
Take this, pillow attack finisher!

00:14:39.070 --> 00:14:41.390
I can't eat anymore.

00:14:45.470 --> 00:14:46.690
Can't sleep?

00:14:47.520 --> 00:14:48.510
No.

00:14:49.050 --> 00:14:53.200
But I'm not lonely anymore.

00:14:53.720 --> 00:14:54.720
Oh, yeah?

00:15:02.660 --> 00:15:03.680
What?

00:15:07.530 --> 00:15:08.930
What's wrong?

00:15:09.500 --> 00:15:10.830
Ranjou-san.

00:15:10.830 --> 00:15:13.800
Shame on you, wetting your bed at your age.

00:15:14.160 --> 00:15:15.630
That's not it!

00:15:15.630 --> 00:15:16.810
Wait, you were awake?

00:15:17.320 --> 00:15:19.270
I'm good at feigning sleep.

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:21.900
Jeez.

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:25.030
Anyway, Maya, let's make a 
wish before we go to sleep.

00:15:25.030 --> 00:15:27.770
So that Nii-sama gets home soon.

00:15:27.770 --> 00:15:28.810
Okay.

00:15:29.830 --> 00:15:33.240
I wish Moroha-san comes home soon.

00:15:29.830 --> 00:15:33.240
I wish Nii-sama comes home soon.

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:38.630
I wish Moroha comes home soon.

00:15:43.800 --> 00:15:45.320
Come quick!

00:15:49.100 --> 00:15:50.580
It's coming.

00:15:50.580 --> 00:15:52.050
What is, Ando?

00:15:54.610 --> 00:15:57.320
It's not just an ordinary Metaphysical.

00:15:57.320 --> 00:16:00.730
It's the Ancient Dragon.

00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:10.560
Good morning, manager.

00:16:13.010 --> 00:16:15.020
What is that?

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:24.040
Th-The sky...

00:16:57.360 --> 00:17:01.620
<i>All non-Striker students please 
evacuate to Stadium One.</i>

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:04.040
<i>This is not a drill.</i>

00:17:04.040 --> 00:17:05.210
<i>I repeat.</i>

00:17:05.210 --> 00:17:09.510
<i>All non-Striker students please 
evacuate to Stadium One.</i>

00:17:06.890 --> 00:17:09.510
The chills I got last night...

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:14.470
It's as if it was waiting 
for Moroha to be absent.

00:17:16.080 --> 00:17:17.470
Don't dismay.

00:17:18.060 --> 00:17:22.170
We just have to attack it without Haimura.

00:17:22.170 --> 00:17:23.930
Let's do this!

00:17:28.730 --> 00:17:33.650
The Metaphysical that emerged 
is a new type, unknown to us.

00:17:34.060 --> 00:17:36.360
Branch coordinator Suruga is hospitalized

00:17:36.360 --> 00:17:38.990
with acute illness. 
He won't be able to deploy.

00:17:41.310 --> 00:17:45.470
Sir Edward of the UK branch 
is currently rushing this way.

00:17:45.870 --> 00:17:47.960
Haimura-kun is still in Russia.

00:17:48.780 --> 00:17:52.490
The principal is currently evacuating 
to prepare a Transportal.

00:17:54.430 --> 00:17:57.480
Until the Transportal is available again,

00:17:58.080 --> 00:18:02.510
we'll have to protect our school 
with the people we have.

00:18:02.940 --> 00:18:07.190
We are fighting for the 
fate of this Akane Academy.

00:18:07.640 --> 00:18:12.190
Everyone, I'm expecting more than your best.

00:18:12.640 --> 00:18:16.950
We don't need Haimura, all he's doing is 
flirting with the Russian beauty, anyway!

00:18:17.260 --> 00:18:20.930
This academy gave me peace.

00:18:20.930 --> 00:18:22.540
I will protect it.

00:18:22.930 --> 00:18:24.700
That's a good attitude.

00:18:25.160 --> 00:18:26.680
Captain Isurugi,

00:18:27.720 --> 00:18:30.600
I'd like to join as backup 
on behalf of the UK branch.

00:18:31.160 --> 00:18:32.210
May I have permission?

00:18:32.800 --> 00:18:33.910
Gladly.

00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:39.720
Angela Johnson hereby 
reporting to the Strikers.

00:18:42.470 --> 00:18:44.720
We are the swords of salvation.

00:18:45.160 --> 00:18:47.230
We are the saviors.

00:18:47.760 --> 00:18:50.730
We are the strike for our people, 
our peace, and our justice.

00:18:51.200 --> 00:18:57.490
We are the strike for our people, 
our peace, and our justice.

00:19:04.920 --> 00:19:06.550
It's so big.

00:19:06.890 --> 00:19:08.810
It's not a hydra, though, and it's

00:19:08.810 --> 00:19:11.630
not as big as the one we 
fought during summer break.

00:19:12.190 --> 00:19:14.670
We can do it, even without Haimura.

00:19:14.670 --> 00:19:18.630
Of course we can. 
Otherwise Akane Academy will vanish.

00:19:22.960 --> 00:19:25.140
Good luck, everyone.

00:19:30.020 --> 00:19:31.220
It smiled.

00:19:31.220 --> 00:19:32.220
What?

00:19:32.220 --> 00:19:33.580
Everyone, fan out!

00:19:33.580 --> 00:19:35.700
It knows our plan!

00:19:47.480 --> 00:19:48.780
Our ambush...

00:19:48.780 --> 00:19:49.910
It figured it out.

00:19:53.870 --> 00:19:55.640
Where did it go?

00:19:55.640 --> 00:19:56.550
Shh.

00:19:57.430 --> 00:19:58.420
It's coming.

00:20:21.560 --> 00:20:22.850
Burning!

00:20:23.400 --> 00:20:25.380
Everyone, leave the forest!

00:20:44.180 --> 00:20:45.640
Run, Satsuki!

00:20:45.640 --> 00:20:46.470
Run!

00:21:03.940 --> 00:21:06.530
Attack with your highest step!

00:21:06.950 --> 00:21:08.660
Bright White Frost!

00:21:08.100 --> 00:21:09.390
Incinerate!

00:21:08.800 --> 00:21:10.490
Lightning!

00:21:29.770 --> 00:21:30.700
No way.

00:21:30.700 --> 00:21:33.720
It's cast a dispel by chanting 
in reverse at high speed.

00:21:34.780 --> 00:21:38.690
It can cancel out any spell.

00:21:39.030 --> 00:21:40.960
Impossible!

00:21:40.960 --> 00:21:44.190
Wait, if it can cancel out any spell...

00:21:44.570 --> 00:21:47.200
It can also use those spell.

00:21:47.900 --> 00:21:49.450
Everyone, anti-fire magic!

00:22:09.580 --> 00:22:10.930
Haimura-han.

00:22:11.500 --> 00:22:13.410
I remember.

00:22:38.960 --> 00:22:43.420
It shows up over and over, 
even when we're reborn.

00:22:44.310 --> 00:22:47.980
The black shadow that takes 
away everything I hold dear.

00:22:48.550 --> 00:22:50.130
That's what it is.

00:23:43.560 --> 00:23:48.540
<i>It was like the flames of 
hell, engulfing everything.</i>

00:23:49.710 --> 00:23:54.800
<i>Our faint wish for Moroha-san to return.</i>

00:23:55.240 --> 00:23:59.060
<i>Our desire to protect the academy.</i>

00:23:59.060 --> 00:24:00.120
<i>Everything.</i>

00:24:00.910 --> 00:24:03.980
<i>It burns through literally everything.</i>

00:24:14.970 --> 00:24:24.850
<b>Preview</b>

00:24:16.600 --> 00:24:19.350
Next time, episode 12: "Beyond Two Lives."

00:24:20.060 --> 00:24:23.040
Boy, break through the chaotic present life.
